      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>Here's where most factories break your heart.</p><p>\"Come back when you have 500 pieces.\" \"We don't do small orders.\" \"You're not ready for us.\"</p><p>We've heard it a thousand times from designers who came to us crying. So we built something different.</p><p>At Modafie, you start at 30 pieces. Not 300. Not 500. Thirty.</p><p>Same quality as the big guys get. Same attention. Same machines. Just... less risk. Less inventory sitting in your bedroom. Less praying you guessed right on sizes.</p><p>Sell out in a week? Brilliant. We'll run your next 30. Or 300. Or 3,000. You grow at your pace, not ours.</p><p><strong>What you get:</strong></p><ul><li>Production from 30 pieces (yes, really)</li><li>European quality that doesn't embarrass you</li><li>Room to make mistakes and learn</li><li>Reorders that don't require a second mortgage</li></ul><p><em>*From €depends on what we are creating. Production 4-6 weeks after sample sign-off.</em></p>",
       "__globals__": {
        "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text"
       },
